{"title":"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are positive integers, how many integers are strictly between the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a81938ca5e71faa6894d9d52ac776c9efbe75d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" />\nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/d/6fd786cba627222b8d7afe99c09fecbddd145bab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+1)(b+1)(c+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"18\" />&#160;? For example, there are 35 integers strictly between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/3/45324826b5d99fc243f7ce05935bb65ed5470486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24=2*3*4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/1/a118fa42c0945f319d25e23fde1794b818c46eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60=3*4*5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We start by expanding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/4/5547c164ce51f19aa252a36d9b66e387527b98d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + 1)(b + 1)(c + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"18\" />, and in doing so we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/2/e522965368d92f2b4156fd97585525329766a1c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc + ab + ac + a + bc + b + c + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"264\" height=\"14\" />. We then subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a81938ca5e71faa6894d9d52ac776c9efbe75d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/2/e522965368d92f2b4156fd97585525329766a1c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc + ab + ac + a + bc + b + c + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"264\" height=\"14\" />, to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/8/f5851e02e04bb8be6ca1b84f8f41ce7268d7c0a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + ac + a + bc + b + c + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"217\" height=\"14\" />. We finally subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from this value, as the problem asks for how many integers are strictly in between, and we get our answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/1/e91f404b094f8753950709675c37687d5a32724d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ab + ac + bc + a + b + c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"198\" height=\"25\" /> as desired.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II\">2006 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"